abstract: >-
  ESS-MAI is an experimental Rust-based research architecture investigating
  Gjata Collapse Law, bounded hierarchical authority, negative knowledge,
  traceable sovereign AI, deterministic reasoning, and executable
  proof-of-concept evidence.
